   "summary": "In compliance with the Paperwork Reduction Act (PRA) of 1995, which requires a 60-day public comment period on proposed information collection projects, the Indian Health Service (IHS) invites the public to take this opportunity to comment on the information collection titled, \"Purchased/Referred Care (PRC) Proof of Residency\" The purpose of this notice is to announce our intent to seek reinstatement of the previously approved information collection by the Office of Management and Budget (OMB), and to allow 60 days for public comment to be submitted to the IHS. A copy of the draft supporting statement is available at www.regulations.gov (see Docket ID IHS_FRDOC___).",
